{"id":"vod_sn_36977","vodId":"36977","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"C3-魔幻三次方","name_cn":"C3-魔幻三次方","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/88b1f90118c6050a1654f21c0f8a5a6f.jpg"},"summary":"夜知春亮（梶裕贵 配音）只是一介平凡无奇的少年，就读于私立大秋高中的他过着味同嚼蜡的独生生活。某日夜里，春亮发觉厨房里有不同寻常的响动，本以为家里进了小偷的春亮却意外发现了一个没穿衣服的少女。　　少女名叫菲娅（田村由加莉 配音），是化为人形的诅咒道具，一番波折之后，诅咒对其无效的春亮和菲娅开始了“幸福甜蜜”的同居生活。之后，黑长直萝莉人形原黑绘（小仓唯 配音）、迷迷糊糊的萨文蕾提（井口裕香 配音）、天才美少女童星樱参白穗（斋藤千和 配音）等祸具少女接二连三的出现在了春亮的身边。她们所要面对的，是一心想要找到并将她们破坏殆尽的神秘组织，而普通人春亮亦被卷入其中。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:47:43","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Wknp22scK61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/n97rTLL6Bn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/FGADGsdWph1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6fxCDRzT9e1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/z1GA1MP2ZJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3Pkvfm0RMH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/WDPbczwgpF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VPqZKF9NBx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Zdd6ZxjEjs1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/A38g82RP3T1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wCCMmXRJDm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wRKw0eZ7EV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jBW8Bw29vH1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:16.473Z"}